        {
          "text": "Rabbiguna sidii Muuse yidhi ayuu yeelay; duqsiyadii badnaana wuu ka kexeeyey Fircoon, iyo addoommadiisii, iyo dadkiisiiba. Mid qudh ahna kama hadhin. ",
